 ## 7\. Design Thinking Approach

 The project ideation can be represented using the design-thinking process.

```
Empathize
   ↓
Understand student learning difficulties
   ↓
Define
   ↓
Identify the need for personalized learning assistance
   ↓
Ideate
   ↓
Generate AI-based learning solutions
   ↓
Prototype
   ↓
Develop EduGenie
   ↓
Test
   ↓
Evaluate and improve the system
```

 ### Empathize

 Understand students' difficulties with learning, revision, and accessing immediate assistance.

 ### Define

 Define the problem as the need for an interactive and personalized learning assistant.

 ### Ideate

 Generate possible AI-based solutions such as tutoring, summarization, quizzes, and personalized learning.

 ### Prototype

 Develop a working application integrating the selected features with Gemini.

 ### Test

 Test the application with different questions, subjects, users, and learning scenarios.

